Package: penm
Type: Package
Title: Build and Perturb Elastic Network Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Julian", "Echave",
                  email = "jechave@unsam.edu.ar",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0678-5593"))
Description: Functions to calculate ENM models, mutate ENMs by perturbing them,
    and measure the resulting differences between wild-type and mutant in
    energy, structure, and motion.
